  "body": "Instead of being one of many similar homes in a tightly packed development, 1/84 Long Drive has its own identity.\r\n\r\nIf buying a brand-new terrace house leaves you wondering about privacy, outdoor space, parking and body corporate restrictions, this is a refreshing alternative.\r\n\r\nSet  on a 325m² fee simple site, this appealing home has an interesting architectural design and a sense of individuality that many rows of newly built terrace homes simply can't replicate. There is room to breathe, room to garden and room to enjoy your own home without feeling like you're living wall-to-wall with your neighbours. Being fee simple means no body corporate dictates property management and there are no regular body corporate fees. You have greater freedom to make decisions about your home and property, subject of course to the usual council and legal requirements.\r\n\r\n• Elevated north-easterly aspect capturing all-day sun\r\n• Two double bedrooms\r\n• Two off-street carparks plus a handy storage unit\r\n• Fenced rear garden – ideal for children, pets, entertaining or simply enjoying your own private outdoor space\r\n• North-facing living and dining with outdoor flow to the deck\r\n• Peep of the harbour from the living area\r\n• Modern kitchen\r\n• Separate laundry\r\n• Guest WC\r\n\r\nPerfect in so many ways, and ready to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that deserves to be seen to be fully appreciated. Make an appointment to view today — you may discover that established character, space and freedom are worth so much more than simply being 'brand new'.",
